# One line ending everywhere: LF in the repository and in every checkout,
# Windows included. core.autocrlf on a Windows clone turned each checkout
# into CRLF, prettier (endOfLine: lf) then failed npm run lint on every
# file, and the "fix" was endOfLine: auto -- which let both endings in.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never normalised, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.pptx binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.npz binary
*.fst binary
*.bin binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
